  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NPCDialogue
  dialogueList:
  - She is beautiful, even now.
  - ' She has blinded Vita since the Unbecoming, under the premise of sheltering
    us from its effects. '
  - But to blind us, she first blinded herself.
  - She likely doesn't even know she has failed to protect us.
  - I wish I could help her see again, but...
  - Well, I haven't the strength, even if I tried.
